  "title": "Numbers and age",
  "note": "One and two change with gender: jeden/jedna/jedno, dwa (m, n) / dwie (f). After 2, 3 and 4 the noun is nominative plural (dwa koty); from 5 up it is genitive plural (pięć kotów). Age uses mieć: Mam dwadzieścia lat, literally \"I have twenty years\" (but 2–4, 22–24: lata).",
